// Ch3 B06 (M2-FP-25), the tidepool (C03): Asha names what lives in the pool; Rhen, a diver, knows
// each by what it sells for. Warmth, and the first time she teases him. Overheard field bark.
title: ch03_bark_causeway_tidepool
location: ch03/saltgrass_causeway
---
Asha [smile]: Look. Star-snail, comb-anemone, and a little lamp-crab under the ledge. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_tidepool_001
Rhen [soft_smile]: Two lume, nothing, and four if you catch him before he sheds. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_tidepool_002
Asha [laugh]: Is that all a pool is to a diver? A price on every shell? #line:ch03_bark_causeway_tidepool_003
Rhen [smile]: The anemone was free. I'm not a monster. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_tidepool_004
===
